  "description": "The polkit packages provide a component for controlling system-wide privileges. This component provides a uniform and organized way for non-privileged processes to communicate with privileged ones.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * polkit: Polkit: Denial of Service via unbounded input processing through standard input (CVE-2026-4897)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
